From 3d5141286dd39471ad72d9865d2612fe0302f430 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozark <ozark@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:02:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] Android Auto quick view: next turn and now playing

A control bar quick view ('android auto') showing Android Auto's next
turn (arrow, distance, street) and the current track (album art, title,
artist). Each half shows while Android Auto keeps sending updates and
hides 30 s after they stop, e.g. when guidance ends or the phone is
unplugged. The turn arrow is tinted to the theme's text colour.

The data was already received (AAHandler's navigation and media
signals) but only the media page used the track metadata.

Upstream-Status: Pending
